# S-40 — LmsProgressSync job (hourly :15). Result 30 Sep 2026 (local, Development): all as expected.
# /dev/jobs lists LmsProgressSyncJob "0 15 * * * ?"; the internal adapter reports what /dev/lms/progress set (dev only)
# E1 (purchase, active, started 13:31) ← 35 % → run → progress_pct 35, started_at kept
# E3 (manual, never synced to the LMS) ← 50 % → skipped (only enrolments with an lms_enrolment_ref are pulled)
# E2 ← 100 %, completed, certificate T3C-2026-0001 → run → completed, completed_at, started_at, certificate_no set
# E1 ← 20 % (lower) → ignored (progress never goes down)
# second run with the same LMS data → rows identical (idempotent); completion hook ran once
# sponsored enrolments: none exist before S-25; the ISponsoredUnitCompletion hook is a registered no-op until S-25 fills it
@dev = http://localhost:5080/dev

### Play the LMS (Development/Staging)
POST {{dev}}/lms/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"enrolmentId":"{{enrolmentId}}","progressPct":100,"completed":true,"certificateNo":"T3C-2026-0001"}

### Run the job now
POST {{dev}}/jobs/LmsProgressSyncJob/run
